<bx:output>
<h1>Slow helper</h1>
<p>Every cell goes through <code>slowFormat()</code> from the application helper: 200 calls of 4 ms each.</p>
<table>
	<bx:loop from="1" to="20" index="r">
		<tr><bx:loop from="1" to="10" index="c"><td>#slowFormat( r * c )#</td></bx:loop></tr>
	</bx:loop>
</table>
</bx:output>
